d headlines about local Republican officials endorsing Kirschner over Gruters. Those signals suggest some crossover discontent, but the district's fundamentals and the money gap still favor the Republican, leaving the race a Lean R with moderate uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.257, "margin": -3.74}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2291, "margin": -5.0}]}